s  choose an availability we'll choose  single zone  [Music]  now we'll launch our cluster  next let's test our cluster using  confluent cli on the google cloud shell  there you have it apache kafka on  confluent cloud with a click of a button  if you enjoyed this video please  subscribe and hit the like button below  we encourage you to check out the gcp  marketplace and deploy the solution on  your own  thanks for watching  [Music]  you
 

